repository-code: "https://github.com/Xstendyl/wellocate"
abstract: >-
  Wellocate is a simulated assay-ordering environment that measures how an agent spends a fixed
  measurement budget under noise, together with the code, the logs and the paper from a
  study of five language models in it.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - sequential experimental design
  - replication
  - measurement noise
  - benchmark environment
